WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.428
[Upbeat electronic music]
Your park is the arena.

00:00:03.428 --> 00:00:06.857
Walk to a real park.
GeoFights only plays inside approved parks and playgrounds.

00:00:06.857 --> 00:00:10.285
Grab free boosters.
Upgrades drop near you. Walk to them to power up your character.

00:00:10.285 --> 00:00:12.000
[Announcer] Here we go!
Ready?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.142
[Announcer] Fight!
Battle players nearby in AR. Hits are real, and the first to zero loses the round.

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:20.571
Built for parks, not pavements.
Battles are stationary. Approved play areas only. Roads, rail and water win.

00:00:20.571 --> 00:00:24.000
Train. Battle. Level up.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.500
[Crowd cheers]
GeoFights. Free to play in your browser. No download.
geofights.com
